Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Você...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:07.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,É tão bom te ver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:25.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sabia que não podíamos\N confiar nesses humanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia do caminho, vampiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Maldito...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:41.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, para onde foi todo aquele poder que mostrou em Shinjuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele está completamente diferente de antes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:53.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Iniciaremos agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Beba o sangue dos humanos, \Ndemônios e seus progenitores.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:04.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual o seu problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:06.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que está fazendo isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Pelo Serafim do Fim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:39.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Está começando, Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.40,Main,,0,0,0,,O poder de entregar a punição divina
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:45.18,Main,,0,0,0,,àqueles que se envolveram\N com práticas proibidas...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos controlá-lo agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.41,Main,,0,0,0,,An—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Anjo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Humanos medíocres, seu fim está próximo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Minha nossa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Tem algo bem incrível acontecendo aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Restrinjam o anjo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Malditos...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,O que estão fazendo com a minha irmã?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Fique quieto, pirralho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.37,Main,,0,0,0,,O que...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Que merda você está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora, Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi?\NNão me erre de propósito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não está certo, Guren.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Por favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,me diga que isso é mentira!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Você...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.19,Main,,0,0,0,,nunca trairia seus companheiros, certo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Diga algo, Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Nós não...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Não somos uma família?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:17.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Aí está.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:51.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Invocado a partir da 5º Trombeta,\N o demônio da destruição,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,A humanidade finalmente
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:05:00.26,Main,,0,0,0,,conseguiu o controle sob os Serafins do Fim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ótimo, continuem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos, recuar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos ir, Kimizuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Não brinque comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Não posso deixar minha irmã aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere, Kimizuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Vocês podem ir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse problema é meu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimizuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:35.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Essa história horrível termina agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:37.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia do meu caminho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,O-O Guren...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan, graças a Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou te levar para algum lugar segu—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde está o Guren?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele estava chorando.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho que ajudá-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda vai continuar com isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:58.46,Main,,0,0,0,,E também...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde a Shinoa e os outros estão?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles ainda estão lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Então eu preciso salvá-los!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles são minha família.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a única família que você tem!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,O Guren,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,a Shinoa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:18.23,Main,,0,0,0,,o Yoichi, o Kimizuki, a Mitsuba e você...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos vocês são minha família, Mika!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,beba um pouco mais do meu sangue, rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Isso não vai funcionar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:53.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vou poder me recuperar com essa barreira.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Então o que temos que fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Não dá para fazer nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquele demônio não pode ser derrotado.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ainda pode sair daqui com vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Rápido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Nunca!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não posso simplesmente \Nfugir e te deixar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Finalmente te encontrei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não posso te deixar e...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia logo daqui seu idiota.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:30.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Você vai acabar perdendo sua família outra vez.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu só preciso acabar com\N esse monstro idiota, não é?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos ficarão bem depois disso, não é?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, use sua cabeça uma vez na vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninguém poderia fazer isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou diferente agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Está tão desesperado \Nassim para salvá-los?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.89,0:09:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Não posso te ajudar mais que isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, você vai me trair\N e vai pegar aquela trombeta?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Traidor maldito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Essa será a pior escolha que você já fez.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Sua humanidade desaparecerá para \Nsempre se você usar essa coisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Contanto que eu possa proteger minha família...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.82,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Krul...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:49.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é mal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles pararam de atacar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Provavelmente por causa daquilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, não pode ser outra coisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Por favor, Yuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Minha irmã...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Kureto-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.86,Main,,0,0,0,,acabamos de detectar\N um Serafim desconhecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,O sinal está vindo daquele pilar de fogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Explique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Não temos mais informações, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No entanto, se o negligenciarmos...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,O mundo ruirá novamente?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Deve ser a nossa punição.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas mesmo que Deus seja nosso inimigo,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,a humanidade continuará seguindo em frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:10:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Destrua-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos os pelotões, em frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu novo alvo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,...é aquele Serafim!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Demônio, você também!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo agora irá ruir.{é uma referência bíblica, então estou mudando pra ficar de acordo}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Humanos tolos, vocês que se\N envolveram com as artes proibidas
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:49.20,Main,,0,0,0,,terminarão suas existências como pilares de sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Recuar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:57.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Não dará tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Fogo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquela é a Segunda Trombeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Kureto-sama, é o Rei do Sal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:16.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa quem seja, matem-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hoje, toda a luxúria e os pecados\N cometidos por vocês, humanos,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,se tornarão pilares de sal—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Pelotões, capturem Hyakuya Yuuichirou!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Prendam-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.19,0:14:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Yuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:22.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que você está um pouco nervoso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Humano ridículo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:29.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso me deixa bem feliz, sabia, Yuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Ver você recorrendo a mim mesmo nesta forma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:38.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Infelizmente, porém,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,esta é a única maneira de suprimir o seu poder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não é bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.02,0:14:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos ir, Krul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Consegue se mover?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sem problemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ótimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:59.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Não deixe que os humanos capturem o Yuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles irão prendê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Não terminei ainda!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:09.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,mas eu sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual o problema, minha rainha?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu pescoço está à mostra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:24.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Maldito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Krul!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Fique longe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Vá!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Olá.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso foi incrível, Ferid-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi incrível como conseguiu vencê-la.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Guarde seus elogios para outra hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Deixando isso de lado,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,não está na hora de me incluir nos seus planos?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Meus adorados companheiros vampiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Descobrimos que Krul Tepes\N vinha conspirando contra nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela estava envolvida no \Nexperimento dos Serafins do Fim!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,E como tal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,eu, o Sétimo Progenitor, Ferid Bathory,\Nestou tomando o comando!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Matem os humanos!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, você ainda está vivo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Que bom que você está bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Narumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Não temos tempo, rápido...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, Tenente-Coronel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Não posso mais obedecer a suas ordens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Narumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:00.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia da frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Não os deixem escapar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Kureto-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:11.56,Main,,0,0,0,,eles estão vindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Vampiros malditos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Matem-nos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:31.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Explique-se, Guren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:35.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Comece a falar...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual a graça?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Não fique tão bravo, Shinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Isto é o que tanto sonhamos \Nconseguir quando éramos mais novos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Estamos mudando o mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde até crianças adotadas como você
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:55.90,Main,,0,0,0,,e membros da família secundária como eu, poderão fazer o que quiserem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Do que está falando?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Seus subordinados morreram!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Por causa da sua traição, muitos dos nos—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Você...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Me escute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Shinoa-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:19.22,Main,,0,0,0,,a irmã do Kimizuki-kun ainda...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:21.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Por hora...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimizuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Nos entreguem Hyakuya Yuuichirou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Isto é uma ordem!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,A partir de agora,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,o Esquadrão de Hiiragi Shinoa está desertando do Exército Imperial Demoníaco Japonês!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Não fiquem aí parados, rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos sobreviver, entenderam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:26.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Kureto-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Estamos prontos para partir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Muito bem, então podemos ir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Pelo visto as coisas estão\N ficando cada vez mais interessantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é tudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,E eles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Já devem estar vindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Vocês demoraram.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, vocês que foram rápidos demais.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu, e o seu demônio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:51.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, não se preocupem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele está dormindo agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ok, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos recuperar a irmã do Kimizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:02.62,Main,,0,0,0,,E enquanto estivermos resolvendo isso, damos um jeito naquele idiota do Guren também.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:09.39,Main,,0,0,0,,O Tenente-Coronel está realmente em Sanguinem?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, a informação que recebi é confiável.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Cara,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:16.99,Main,,0,0,0,,tivemos tanto trabalho para escapar daquele lugar, e agora vamos voltar para lá?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:20.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar tudo bem, desde \Nque você continue com a cabeça no lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.31,Main,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com isso, Mika?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Do que está falando, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Só estamos falando que você provavelmente\N ficará mais idiota do que está agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, isso foi rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele ficará bem, não é como\N se existisse alguém mais idiota.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.34,Main,,0,0,0,,É como ela disse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Que bom, não é, Yuu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:43.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai começar a chover.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
